uwen zoekt voor het spaceshuttleprogramma. De mogelijkheid zelf de ruimte in te gaan verandert haar toekomstbeeld. In 1980 begint zij aan de astronautenopleiding in Houston, samen met kandidaten die uiteenlopende vaardigheden en geheimen meebrengen. Tijdens de voorbereiding ontstaan vriendschappen en een liefde die haar zekerheden verder verschuift. Taylor Jenkins Reid verbindt Joans professionele ambitie met vragen over verbondenheid en de plaats die iemand voor zichzelf in de wereld durft op te eisen.","work_id":987147013,"evidence":[{"note":"Retain Work3492 Atmosphere / Taylor Jenkins Reid; exact Dutch Atmosphere ISBN 9789026370953 Paperback. KB exact-title, author and original-title references compared with the existing source-edition parent. Reuse original content review content-review-031.json. No new Work, changed first-publication year, merged author, additional Dutch availability or taste classification is proposed.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p444732098"],"reference":"work:3492","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.993Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-031.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL42412330W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p444732098"]},{"note":"Exact bound prior bulk-source attempt retained. No verified asset imported; existing shared resolver retained. Hosted exact-edition decoded front or documentedneutralplaceholder stillrequired.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789026370953","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":15171187,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"da70559e4d5f2dd3576e79714062a3263062ebe5401e0ef0ac880c708f94ec64"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.997Z","editionKey":"/books/OL61339428M","limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no co